# Specialist UI

- React 18 + Vite + TypeScript + Tailwind + React Router. No Next.js.
- Screens: login, queue, claim workspace, audit timeline. No provider portal or member UI.
- Workspace must show claim summary, three agent cards, proposed decision, editable letter, Approve and Escalate.
- Call `/api/v1/specialist/*` with JWT. Poll the queue (e.g. 5s); no WebSockets.
- Approve/escalate only when status is `AWAITING_HUMAN` or `ESCALATED`. Never send email/SMS from the UI.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — hide agent findings
<DecisionForm decision={proposed} />

// ✅ GOOD — NFR-20: findings + editable letter + actions
<AgentCards policy={p} fraud={f} mednec={m} />
<textarea value={letter} onChange={...} />
<button onClick={approve}>Approve</button>
<button onClick={escalate}>Escalate</button>
```
